      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 4yo is really sick and has a crazy high fever like 103.5. he's only 42 lbs and he's being really fussy and won't sleep. i have the children's liquid acetaminophen (the 160mg per 5ml kind) in the cabinet but i'm so stressed i don't know how much to give him. can you tell me exactly how many ml i should give him right now to get this fever down?? i'm alone right now and really need to know the right amount.",
